From: static_bins maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] aarch64: include sys/types.h for pid_t

The AArch64 fetch backend includes proc.h, which exposes pid_t. Do not depend
on another system header providing that type transitively; musl does not do so
in this include order.
---
 sysdeps/linux-gnu/aarch64/fetch.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/sysdeps/linux-gnu/aarch64/fetch.c b/sysdeps/linux-gnu/aarch64/fetch.c
index 03e4f91..196ee6e 100644
--- a/sysdeps/linux-gnu/aarch64/fetch.c
+++ b/sysdeps/linux-gnu/aarch64/fetch.c
@@ -21,0 +22 @@
+#include <sys/types.h>
